# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets / sensitive artifacts — never commit
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Raw GCP resource exports may contain plaintext env-var secrets
# (AWS keys, New Relic license keys, JWTs etc.). Always review before
# moving anything out of temp/ into the tracked tree.
temp/

# Captured HTTP traffic (HAR files, request dumps) — typically contain
# auth tokens, JWTs, PII.
*.har
pre-migration-apis-testing/transactions.*
pre-migration-apis-testing/rocketpay_env.json
pre-migration-apis-testing/rocketpay_collection.json

# Generic credential / env files
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
*-key.json

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AWS-side migration artifacts — this repo is GCP-only.
# Local copies are fine; they just don't belong in version control.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
load-balancers/*/aws-audit/
local-docs/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LB state — local-only scratch
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Exports created by scripts/lb_apply.sh and scripts/lb_diff.sh while
# they fetch the live URL map to compare against repo state.
*.live.yaml
*.live.tmp.yaml

# Backups created by sed -i.bak and manual snapshots
*.backup
*.bak

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor noise
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.codegraph
